  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [eslint-config-algolia](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia) from `v12.0.0` to `v13.0.1`\n\n**Note**: This PR was created on a configured schedule (\"every weekend\" in timezone `Europe/Paris`) and will not receive updates outside those times.\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Release Notes</summary>\n\n### [`v13.0.0`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;1300httpsgithubcomalgoliaeslint-config-algoliacomparev1100v1300-2017-11-25)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n* **deps:** update dependency react to v^16.0.0 ([52f6213](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/52f6213))\n##### Features\n\n* **jest:** move into its own file ([2259ed6](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/2259ed6))\n* **react:** disallow binding in render ([a1d725a](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/a1d725a))\n\n---\n\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n\n#### v13.0.0\n-   [`f362c13`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/f362c132afc1acb6c9ff84555aa6def0fa1381b6) Add renovate.json\n-   [`101e353`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/101e353a4dd328e93dc518acb48adfe1ba9cd499) Merge pull request #&#8203;50 from algolia/renovate/configure\n-   [`4a0a0a9`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/4a0a0a9b670ad87344a4fbe737feaa97a7adcce7) refactor(deps): pin dependencies\n-   [`5015c13`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/5015c13fd3a29579509b4fba6f83ef69b5396aa7) Merge pull request #&#8203;51 from algolia/renovate/pin-dependencies\n-   [`eba39ce`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/eba39ceb85c3593f4b3caaf4016fbfb0ca399302) chore(deps): update dependency babel-eslint to v8.0.1\n-   [`47bc0cb`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/47bc0cba3923af7cb32d0a6c68a6c2af05787cac) chore(deps): renovate jest monorepo packages\n-   [`52f6213`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/52f6213cb4972102a9594ae432f218da99959883) fix(deps): update dependency react to v^16.0.0\n-   [`5547a2d`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/5547a2d9e14e1b982e256ecbac26dc459cde26f0) Merge pull request #&#8203;52 from algolia/renovate/babel-eslint-8.x\n-   [`3ac9b9d`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/3ac9b9d03124b30106eadfcdb9f19ff1b93f0e87) Merge pull request #&#8203;55 from algolia/renovate/jest-monorepo\n-   [`ed5c579`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/ed5c57969177c28b3675bf86d8fcb34306affdb6) Merge pull request #&#8203;56 from algolia/renovate/react-monorepo\n-   [`fab3e0c`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/fab3e0cc1292af01caaea538bfe46f032fc0daeb) chore(deps): update dependency eslint-plugin-import to v2.8.0\n-   [`4eefbf5`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/4eefbf5a6e77209666e1c016dc995f1931e96f85) Merge pull request #&#8203;57 from algolia/renovate/eslint-plugin-import-2.x\n-   [`a0fe5c7`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/a0fe5c77831788bb82c055df1b33ab220bf22ca6) chore(deps): update dependency eslint to v4.10.0\n-   [`91a526d`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/91a526d9029f80ab11ef893363617ccf4d85b957) chore(deps): update dependency eslint-config-prettier to v2.7.0\n-   [`a4c3342`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/a4c3342ff0833057be722566a00893f96201a4ce) Merge pull request #&#8203;59 from algolia/renovate/eslint-config-prettier-2.x\n-   [`f9a9b6c`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/f9a9b6ce25fe34fe5e974bf807d359aec74f2f44) chore(deps): update dependency eslint-plugin-jest to v21.3.0\n-   [`d9151b4`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/d9151b453156e2b6abf82e18a76ea7da0c1790a3) chore(deps): update dependency prettier to v1.8.2\n-   [`50841bd`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/50841bde2b74ab57cd3abb0de974223834167545) Merge pull request #&#8203;62 from algolia/renovate/jest-monorepo\n-   [`3fd788a`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/3fd788ac3f6e446291bdd71854c15d1af532a9ca) chore(deps): update dependency eslint-plugin-jest to v21.3.2\n-   [`4aef268`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/4aef26801085884bc396ff879bd85ba7d643c89e) Merge pull request #&#8203;58 from algolia/renovate/eslint-4.x\n-   [`ec1f02e`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/ec1f02ebf60faed68ab9fb03a373aed230a06301) Merge pull request #&#8203;61 from algolia/renovate/prettier-1.x\n-   [`13327c4`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/13327c4ae7d5af38bb94fcd8a916b5edc7586f2b) Merge pull request #&#8203;63 from algolia/renovate/jest-monorepo\n-   [`0835c48`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/0835c48a87779ac0307d2e603ccf16e6ab021c1e) chore(deps): update dependency eslint to v4.11.0\n-   [`3b8cffe`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/3b8cffeb4718339115c02cfda7739723d7dca268) chore(deps): update dependency conventional-changelog-cli to v1.3.5\n-   [`e62aff8`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/e62aff85fee8d3c5465245ed84f7c83ba2d782e8) Merge pull request #&#8203;64 from algolia/renovate/eslint-4.x\n-   [`d47becc`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/d47becc68ee68711508c6cc087a1875cd8009cc0) Merge pull request #&#8203;65 from algolia/renovate/conventional-changelog-cli-1.x\n-   [`d2edf95`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/d2edf95c9c721887dd419167bf95a7a6ad0ceb27) chore(deps): update dependency babel-eslint to v8.0.2\n-   [`3530c6b`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/3530c6b4a42a3a13983f4c24d302d9967e300614) chore(deps): update dependency eslint-config-prettier to v2.8.0\n-   [`a11c428`](https://github.com/algolia/eslint-config-algolia/commit/a11c42884577002c0840937f352